    "source": "deviantart",
    "type": "post",
    "title": "Starlord",
    "text": "\"The Starlord\" aka what happens when you're drunk and feel like mixing space art with surrealism   This is a very atypical use of Vue - instead of doing postwork on a render, I went the other way around by painting the elements in PS then bringing them in Vue via Camera Mapping techniques and build a 3D scene around them. This allowed me to quickly generate a waterscape and its nice reflections, haze, mist and lens glare. \n\nCheers to cosmicspark for this cool nebula stock\n\nFollow me on:\nFacebook for more updates and making of-s.\nInstagram for nature photos \nArtstation to support my art there too!",
    "url": "https://www.deviantart.com/suirebit/art/Starlord-605306011",
    "published_at": "2016-04-26T03:00:08.000Z",
    "fetched_at": "2026-11-25T20:23:05.222Z"
  },
